  "day_cn": "周二",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-03-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-03-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">正念与慢生活 (Mindfulness, Slowing Down &amp; Digital Detox)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Hey, you look incredibly relaxed today. Did you finally take a real break this weekend?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I did! I decided to completely <strong>put myself on airplane mode</strong> from Friday night onwards. I just had to <strong>step off the hamster wheel</strong> for a bit. My brain was completely <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">fried</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Good for you! I usually struggle to <strong>dial down the noise</strong> when I&#x27;m stressed. I always end up scrolling or checking emails <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">out of habit</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I used to do exactly that. But this time, I actually managed to <strong>embrace JOMO</strong>. I honestly didn&#x27;t care about what parties or events everyone else was at. On Saturday, I went for a massive hike in the hills just to <strong>blow away the cobwebs</strong>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">That sounds absolutely amazing. Honestly, I really need to <strong>declutter my headspace</strong> too. My mind is constantly <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">racing</span>. Did you do any actual meditation?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">A little bit. But mostly, I just allowed myself to sit on the porch and <strong>stare into the middle distance</strong>. It’s surprisingly hard at first because we’re so used to being stimulated, but once you <strong>lean into the quiet</strong>, it’s pure magic.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Wow. Hearing that makes me want to <strong>go monk mode</strong> next weekend. I might just delete all my social media apps temporarily and just exist.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I highly recommend it! It’s genuinely the most effective way to <strong>fill your cup</strong> before Monday rolls around again. You can&#x27;t <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">pour from an empty vessel</span>, right?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Absolutely right. I&#x27;m definitely giving it a try.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：嘿，你今天看起来特别放松。这个周末你终于好好休息了一下吗？（Hey, you look incredibly relaxed today. Did you finally take a real break this weekend?）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：是的！我决定从周五晚上开始完全<strong>让自己开启飞行模式</strong>。我就是需要暂时<strong>跳出这日复一日的疲劳循环</strong>。我的脑子之前彻底（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">烧坏了</span>）。（I did! I decided to completely put myself on airplane mode from Friday night onwards. I just had to step off the hamster wheel for a bit. My brain was completely fried.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：真替你高兴！我压力大的时候通常很难<strong>屏蔽外界的喧嚣</strong>。我总会（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">出于习惯</span>）不停地刷手机或者查邮件。（Good for you! I usually struggle to dial down the noise when I&#x27;m stressed. I always end up scrolling or checking emails out of habit.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：我以前也完全是那样。但这一次，我居然做到了<strong>拥抱“错失的乐趣”</strong>。我真心不在乎其他人都在参加什么派对或活动。周六的时候，我去山里徒步了很久，就为了<strong>去户外透透气、清醒一下头脑</strong>。（I used to do exactly that. But this time, I actually managed to embrace JOMO. I honestly didn&#x27;t care about what parties or events everyone else was at. On Saturday, I went for a massive hike in the hills just to blow away the cobwebs.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：听起来太棒了。说实话，我也真的需要<strong>清理一下大脑的思绪</strong>了。我的脑子总是在（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">飞速运转</span>）。你做真正的冥想了吗？（That sounds absolutely amazing. Honestly, I really need to declutter my headspace too. My mind is constantly racing. Did you do any actual meditation?）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：做了一点点。但大部分时间，我只是让自己坐在门廊上，<strong>毫无目的地发呆</strong>。一开始这出奇地难，因为我们太习惯于接受外界刺激了，但一旦你<strong>顺应并享受这份宁静</strong>，感觉简直太奇妙了。（A little bit. But mostly, I just allowed myself to sit on the porch and stare into the middle distance. It’s surprisingly hard at first because we’re so used to being stimulated, but once you lean into the quiet, it’s pure magic.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：哇。听你这么一说，我都想下周末<strong>进入“和尚模式”（断绝社交与干扰）</strong>了。我可能真的会暂时删掉所有的社交软件，仅仅是感受存在。（Wow. Hearing that makes me want to go monk mode next weekend. I might just delete all my social media apps temporarily and just exist.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：强烈推荐！在周一再次到来之前，这绝对是<strong>补充内在能量</strong>最有效的方式。你总不能（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">空杯倒水/精力耗尽还去强撑</span>），对吧？（I highly recommend it! It’s genuinely the most effective way to fill your cup before Monday rolls around again. You can&#x27;t pour from an empty vessel, right?）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：完全正确。我肯定要试一下。（Absolutely right. I&#x27;m definitely giving it a try.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>put oneself on airplane mode</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 让自己开启飞行模式（指切断电子设备联系，不理会外界信息）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述数字排毒或彻底放松、不回消息的状态。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>step off the hamster wheel</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 跳出仓鼠轮（指摆脱日复一日、令人疲惫且毫无意义的忙碌循环）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈论休假、辞职或摆脱内卷、寻求慢生活时使用。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>dial down the noise</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 调低噪音（引申为减少外界干扰、屏蔽冗余信息或焦虑源）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述在信息爆炸或压力大的环境中寻求内心平静。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>embrace JOMO</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 拥抱错失的乐趣（Joy of Missing Out，与 FOMO 相对，指享受不去凑热闹、独处的快乐）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/网络流行语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈论拒绝无效社交、享受个人时光。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>blow away the cobwebs</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 吹走蛛网（指通过去户外呼吸新鲜空气或运动来使头脑清醒、焕发精神）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/爱尔兰</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 久坐或宅家后，出门散步以恢复精力。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>declutter one&#x27;s headspace</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 清理大脑空间（指清除杂念、理清思绪）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈论心理健康、冥想或通过放松来减轻心理负担。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>stare into the middle distance</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 毫无焦点地凝视半空（发呆、放空自己）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述不看手机、不思考特定事物，让大脑彻底放空的动作。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>lean into the quiet</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 顺应并享受宁静（不逃避安静，主动接纳无外界刺激的状态）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/心理咨询用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 探讨正念练习，克服初期对没有手机和噪音的不适感。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>go monk mode</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 进入和尚模式（指极致的专注或彻底屏蔽一切社交和电子干扰）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 Gen Z/网络流行语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述为了深度工作、学习或深度放松而断绝一切外界联系。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>fill one&#x27;s cup</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 注满自己的杯子（指补充自己的情感、心理或身体能量）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/心理健康领域</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 强调自我关怀（self-care），在照顾他人或投入工作前先照顾好自己。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Transnational curriculum and assessment fairness</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1002/curj.70094</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">transnational curriculum language assessment fairness justice multilingual qualification policy</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的跨国资格与课程公平研究，优先概念创新和可迁移诊断框架。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能推进尺度、治理、证据语言与可被命名的不公平之间关系的文章。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
