  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/02/a-new-path-to-political-power-in-china-runs-through-state-firms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">在中国，通向政治权力的新途径：国有企业</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A new path to political power in China runs through state firms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项分析指出，越来越多的中国地方党政领导干部拥有在国有企业任职的背景，这表明国企正日益成为干部晋升的关键跳板，可能预示着中国政治生态的新变化。（独立分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/australasia/article/3373054/australia-jails-singaporean-tourist-fatally-driving-over-man-who-stole-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">澳大利亚判处新加坡游客入狱，因其驾车撞死抢走背包的男子</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Australia jails Singaporean tourist for fatally driving over man who stole backpack</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名新加坡游客在澳大利亚因驾车撞死一名抢走其背包的男子而被判处三年半监禁。这起案件引发了公众对自卫与过失杀人界限的讨论，尤其是在异国他乡遭遇犯罪时如何合法应对的争议。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/03/2003867047\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台湾陆委会官员：北京将加大对台“侵略”力度</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Beijing to step up aggression: MAC official</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾陆委会一位官员警告称，北京未来将加强对台湾的“侵略性”行动，这番言论是在两岸关系日趋紧张的背景下发表的，反映出台湾方面对中国大陆政策走向的担忧。（台湾官方）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/newsletters/2026/11/trump-midterms-speech-reflecting-pool/689259/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">唐纳德·特朗普或许不希望他的政党赢得中期选举</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Maybe Donald Trump Doesn’t Want His Party to Win the Midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有观点认为，唐纳德·特朗普可能并不真心希望共和党在中期选举中大获全胜，因为这会削弱他作为党内“造王者”的地位，从而影响他未来参选总统的潜在优势。（评论性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/02/us-midterm-elections-trump-speech-reflecting-pool-democrats-republicans/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普中期选举的最后信息</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump’s Closing Midterm Message</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">前总统特朗普在中期选举前夕发表了最后的信息，呼吁选民支持共和党候选人，并重申了他对选举舞弊的质疑。这番讲话旨在巩固其支持者基础，并为未来政治行动铺垫。（右翼视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/03/republicans-midterms-loss-blame-trump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">共和党中期选举“甩锅”游戏提前上演</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">GOP&#x27;s midterm blame game starts early</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在距离美国中期选举尚有时日之际，共和党内部已开始出现相互指责的迹象，各方试图在潜在的选举结果不佳前，将责任推给他人，这反映了党内对选情并不乐观的担忧。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/02/nx-s1-6025407/chatbots-midterms-voting-advice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">AI聊天机器人成政治顾问，其答案或误导选民</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">AI chatbots are becoming political advisers. Their answers can mislead voters</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着人工智能聊天机器人在政治领域的应用日益广泛，研究显示其提供的信息可能存在偏见和不准确性，引发人们对AI影响选举公正性的担忧。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261103-russian-strikes-kill-26-in-ukraine-after-longest-ceasefire-ends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">乌克兰最长停火协议结束后，俄罗斯袭击造成26人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Russian strikes kill 26 in Ukraine after longest ceasefire ends</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在乌克兰最长的停火协议结束后，俄罗斯对乌克兰发动空袭，造成至少26人死亡，此次袭击标志着冲突的再次升级，引发国际社会关注。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/02/british-adventurer-returns-home-after-28-year-journey-around-the-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">英国探险家结束28年环球之旅载誉归来</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">British adventurer returns home after 28-year journey around the world</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名英国探险家在完成长达28年的环球旅行后平安返回家乡，他的非凡壮举涵盖了陆地和海上旅程，向世界展示了人类的毅力和冒险精神。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cjy56dndlyz0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">基辅称俄罗斯轰炸乌克兰援助中心，造成26人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Russian bombing kills 26 people at Ukraine aid centre, Kyiv says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">基辅方面表示，俄罗斯对一个乌克兰人道援助中心发动了致命轰炸，造成26名平民死亡，乌克兰谴责此举违反国际法，人道主义危机进一步加剧。（乌克兰官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/usa/2026-11-02/united-states-holds-referendum-on-the-end-of-trumpism.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国举行“特朗普主义终结”全民公投</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">United States holds referendum on the end of Trumpism</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国举行了一场关于“特朗普主义终结”的全民公投，旨在评估民众对前总统特朗普政治遗产的看法和未来政治走向，此次公投将对美国政治版图产生深远影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/2026/nov/02/fossilised-red-blood-cells-aratasaurus-dinosaurs-bone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">科学家在1.15亿年前恐龙骨骼中发现化石红细胞</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Fossilised red blood cells found in 115m-year-old dinosaur’s bone, say scientists</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">科学家们在一块有1.15亿年历史的恐龙骨骼化石中，首次发现了保存完好的红细胞，这一发现为研究恐龙生理学和古生物学提供了宝贵的新线索。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-03/launceston-city-council-job-cuts-qvmag/107340184\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">朗塞斯顿市议会为节省190万澳元，博物馆岗位或将裁撤</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Museum jobs set to go as Launceston council looks to save $1.9m</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州朗塞斯顿市议会正计划通过裁撤博物馆职位来削减190万澳元的开支，此举引发了对当地文化机构未来运营和就业前景的担忧。（地方报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/rubio-meets-venezuelan-counterpart-as-us-presses-for-progress-on-election-preparations/article71658514.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国持续施压委内瑞拉筹备选举之际，鲁比奥会见委内瑞拉官员</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Rubio meets Venezuelan counterpart as U.S. presses for progress on election preparations</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在美国继续推动委内瑞拉大选筹备取得进展的背景下，美国参议员马可·鲁比奥会见了委内瑞拉反对派代表，这表明华盛顿正积极介入委内瑞拉政治进程，旨在促进民主转型。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2335163/barmm-opens-applications-for-top-govt-positions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">棉兰老穆斯林邦撒摩罗自治区开放高级政府职位申请</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">BARMM opens applications for top gov’t positions</div><div style=\"display:flex;alig